      "name": "Configurable Experience",
      "slug": "configurable-experience",
      "teaser": "Configure the skill experience multiplier and toggle skill fatigue.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2588.png",
      "downloads": 6893,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<p><strong>HOW IT WORKS:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Adds the possibility to change the default skill multiplier.</li>\n<li>Adds the possibility to enable/disable the skill fatigue system.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>You can enable/disable the changes to the skill fatigue system alongside the default skill multiplier using the in-game config menu (F12)</strong></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TYH3Ctp.png\" alt=\"TYH3Ctp.png\" /></p>\n<p>Note: Since metabolism XP rewards are very high by default, I added the possibility to disable the multiplier for the metabolism skill.</p>\n<p><strong>CHANGES FROM VANILLA:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The Skill fatigue system is disabled by default.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>FUTURE ADDITIONS:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Add the possibility to configure the multiplier for each individual Skill.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Big thanks to everyone, hope you guys enjoy and remember to report any bug/suggestion in the comments!</p>\n",
